    summary: "Housing, Infrastructure and Communities Minister Sean Fraser allocates $350 million from the Housing Accelerator Fund to construct municipal water mains, electrical substations, and pedestrian plazas unlocking 15,000 modular homes near passenger rail stations across Canada.",
